<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE task PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Task//EN" "task.dtd">
<task id="CollaboratingusingOutlook_ToCollaborateUsingOutlook" xml:lang="en">
   <title>To Collaborate Using Outlook</title>
   <taskbody>
      <prereq id="prereq_cbp_f1w_12c">
         <p>The X-Author Outlook add-in must have been installed and you are connected.</p>
      </prereq><steps>
         <step>
            <cmd>Click <uicontrol>Chatter</uicontrol> from the <uicontrol>X-Author</uicontrol>
               Chatter ribbon.</cmd>
            <stepresult>
               <p>Chatter opens in its own window within Outlook and you may need to resize it for
                  optimal viewing.</p>
            </stepresult>
         </step>
         <step><cmd>Select who you want to collaborate within your Chatter feed by clicking one of the icons:</cmd><info><p>
               <table>
                  <tgroup cols="2">
                     <colspec colname="col1"/>
                     <colspec colname="col2"/>
                     <tbody>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                                 <fig id="fig_spw_41w_12c">
                                    <image height="16" placement="break"
                                       href="../attachments/98671234/98671210.jpg"
                                       id="image_tpw_41w_12c"/>
                                 </fig>
                           </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Your audience will be everyone in your organization with a Chatter account.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                                 <fig id="fig_ppf_p1w_12c">
                                    <image height="16" placement="break"
                                       href="../attachments/98671234/98671208.jpg"
                                       id="image_qpf_p1w_12c"/>
                                 </fig>
                           </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Your audience will be all the members of the group you select.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                                 <fig id="fig_tj3_p1w_12c">
                                    <image height="16" placement="break"
                                       href="../attachments/98671234/98671207.jpg"
                                       id="image_uj3_p1w_12c"/>
                                 </fig>
                           </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Your audience will be the single individual you select.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                     </tbody>
                  </tgroup>
               </table>
            </p>
         </info></step>
         <step><cmd> Select how you want to share content in the feed</cmd><info><fig>
               <image height="225" placement="break" href="../attachments/98671234/98671233.jpg"/>
            </fig>
            <p>
               <table>
                  <tgroup cols="2">
                     <colspec colname="col1"/>
                     <colspec colname="col2"/>
                     <thead><row>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Post</p>
                           </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Enter a comment to solicit feedback, while not copying any content from the body of the email or any email attachments.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row></thead>
                     <tbody>
                        
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Selected Content</p>
                           </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Highlight content from the body of your email and it will be included in the feed entry, without any formatting.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Attachments</p>
                           </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>For a single attachment, select whether to Upload as a new version to an existing file or to Upload as a new file. A new version means that it would become the new version to a file you already have in your Chatter &gt; Files.</p>
                              <p>You use the Upload Version dialog box to search for the file stored in Chatter you want to attach as the new version. A new file is added to your Chatter feed and subsequently is available from Chatter &gt; Files.</p>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Message</p>
                           </entry>
                           <entry>
                              <p>Selecting this enables a drop-down list with the following options:</p>
                              <ul>
                                 <li>.doc - Attaches the email to the feed as a Word file.</li>
                                 <li>.html - Attaches the email to the feed as anhtmlfile.</li>
                                 <li>.msg - Packages the email and all attachments into an Outlook .msg file and attaches it to the feed. This file can only be opened with Outlook.</li>
                                 <li>.rtf - Attaches the email to the feed as a Word file.</li>
                                 <li>.txt - Attaches the email to the feed as a text file.</li>
                              </ul>
                           </entry>
                        </row>
                     </tbody>
                  </tgroup>
               </table>
            </p>
         </info></step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Click <uicontrol>Share</uicontrol> to share your content to the Chatter feed.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Click <uicontrol>Refresh</uicontrol> to ensure you feed is up to date and that you
               receive feedback from your colleagues.</cmd>
         </step>
      </steps></taskbody>
</task>
